u Hatano","role":"Yo Fujiura (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/i1meHlOXLP2ubJZkmyGJONrxikQ.jpg"},{"id":90572,"name":"Yukana","role":"Fujiko Tsubomi (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AeRUkifrHsx0ZYfRRf64gChACyg.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Unlimited Psychic Squad","overview":"Una brezza agita i bei capelli argentati sulla testa di un giovane che indossa un'uniforme così nera che sembra essere in lutto per qualcosa. Il suo nome è Hyoubu Kyousuke. Comanda l'organizzazione criminale esper P.A.N.D.R.A. e continua a librarsi su ali nere come la mezzanotte nel cielo scuro, arrivando al punto di iniziare una rivoluzione per il bene dei suoi fratelli che condividono i suoi poteri psichici. L'eroe antagonista dell'opera originale di Shiina Takashi, Zettai Karen Children, è il protagonista della storia originale in questo nuovo anime spin-off! Combatti contro il destino del tempo stesso e libera l'infinito!"},{"language":"en-US","title":"Unlimited Psychic Squad","overview":"You don't have to be psychic to know that Hyobu Kyosuke is trouble waiting to happen, but having psychic powers of your own may be your only chance if you want to stand against him. One of the most powerful espers on the planet, Hyobu's incredible range of abilities extends as far as controlling his own aging process, and the potential strength of all his talents combined is so terrifying that he wears a device that limits their use except in cases of extreme emergency. The time is coming, however, when Hyobu will need to unleash everything he has.\n\nSometimes it takes a villain to do what heroes can't, and as the leader of the secret organization P.A.N.D.R.A., Hyobu's dedicated his life to fighting those who would entrap, enslave, or kill anyone with psychic powers. Now P.A.N.D.R.A. itself is in danger and, to combat that deadly threat, the gloves and limiter are coming off!"},{"language":"ja-JP","overview":"椎名高志原作「絶対可憐チルドレン」に生まれた偽悪のヒーロー、兵部京介がオリジナルストーリーによるスピンオフ・アニメーションとなって登場。風になびく美しい銀髪、何かを悼むかのようにその身にまとった漆黒の学ランを着た青年…彼の名は兵部京介。エスパー犯罪組織パンドラを指揮し、超能力者の同胞たちのために革命を起こすまで、その黒い翼は闇の空を羽ばたき続ける…。"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wMZxCyRKhhL3ov88duiX4c44u1X.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wMZxCyRKhhL3ov88duiX4c44u1X.png","language":"en","width":784,"height":298},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5JOTYIKfSgOSNRxUyO6rW29o3MS.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5JOTYIKfSgOSNRxUyO6rW29o3MS.png","language":"en","width":738,"height":302}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rq8JOQgLfZ9LIC9FmcRrA1nWlyr.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rq8JOQgLfZ9LIC9FmcRrA1nWlyr.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/crOLPagsV0xan7qcP5x4YQ22dlX.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/crOLPagsV0xan7qcP5x4YQ22dlX.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qM9STqaBvSPXtYbASXfaES733DL.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qM9STqaBvSPXtYbASXfaES733DL.jpg","language":"en","width":640,"height":960},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/x1f0ODWHwd24TdxWusmH3LHTcez.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/x1f0ODWHwd24TdxWusmH3LHTcez.jpg","language":"en","width":960,"height":1440},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zd6zRbgsReMvB5Xp5KELib1juPd.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zd6zRbgsReMvB5Xp5KELib1juPd.jpg","language":"ja","width":666,"height":999}],"backdrops":[{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gNclYHhYcMBm5UOBpfFl45xTrq7.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gNclYHhYcMBm5UOBpfFl45xTrq7.jpg","language":"xx","width":1600,"height":898},{"type":"backdrop","url":"htt